pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"The identifier `device-001` available in the inventory. If you already used it, choose another and issue the certificate with that same `Common Name`."},"1660":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"A DMS must exist before registering the device. If you already have a suitable one, check its CA and note its identifier; to create one:"},"1661":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"Open the DMS inventory and its creation action. Assign a recognizable name, such as `Acme Evaluation DMS`."},"1662":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"In **Enrollment CA**, select the CA that issued `device.crt`."},"1663":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"In **Registration Mode**, select `PRE_REGISTRATION` for the path that starts with explicit registration."},"1664":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/pla