"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management-88","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management#sign-and-verify","content":"Sign a test message, save the signature and verify it using the same public key, algorithm and encoding. Then change the message: verification should fail. This tests one operation; it does not establish every engine capability or a CA’s chain."},"2278":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management-89","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management#sign-and-verify","content":"When you open it, two areas appear: **Sign** and **Verify**."},"2279":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management-90","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management#sign","content":"This tab uses the private key to generate a digital signature over a message or an already computed *digest*."},"2280":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management-91","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management#sign","content":"Main fields:"},"2281":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management-92","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management#sign","content":"**Algorithm**: signing algorithm available for the key type."},"2282":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management-93","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/key-management#sign","content":"**Message Type**: `Raw` for clear data or `Digest` for a precomputed hash."},"2283":{"id":"/docs/pr-previ