review/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#start-the-issuance","content":"Open the CA from the previous path, go to **Issued Certificates** and select **Issue New**."},"2448":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#choose-the-method","content":"Select **Generate Key & CSR in Browser** to follow this example."},"2449":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#choose-the-method","content":"If the key must be generated and kept on the destination system, use **Upload Existing CSR**, described in the authorities guide."},"2450":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identify-the-certificate","content":"Enter `device-001` as the `Common Name`. Add subject details required by your policy and SANs if the consumer uses them to identify the client."},"2451":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identify-the-certificate","content":"If you continue with manual registration, the `Device ID` will be exactly `device-001`."},"2452":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configure-key-and-uses","content":"Choose an algorithm and size allowed by the profile; for example, ECDSA P-256 if permitted. For this client certificate, select **Digital Signature** and **Client Authentication**, and issue it as an end-entity certificate."},"2453":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configure-key-and-uses","content":"Request, for example, 30 days of validity, always within the CA's lifetime. Review the issuance profile if the resulting content differs from the request."},"2454":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#issue-and-download","content":"Confirm issuance. Save the PEM certificate as `device.crt` and the private key as `device.key` in your prepared directory."},"2455":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verify-the-result","content":"Check in **Issued Certificates** that the certificate appears active. Note its serial number and verify the downloaded material using the checks below."},"2456":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inspect-content-and-dates","content":"Check `CN=device-001`, the expected issuer, current validity, **Digital Signature** and 