"acción preventiva y propietario."},"464":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"page","content":"Control de acceso","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Administración"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control"},"465":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control","content":"Diseña quién puede acceder a Lamassu mediante principales, políticas, permisos sobre recursos y autorización de rutas HTTP."},"466":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control#conceptos-esenciales","content":"Conceptos esenciales"},"467":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control#dos-sistemas-de-decisión","content":"Dos sistemas de decisión"},"468":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-http-integrados-o-externos","content":"Servicios HTTP integrados o externos"},"469":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/administration/access-control